OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Bishop surprises Sean Styles 
OL,4,Aduring final radio show                
OL,6,FA BBC radio presenter received a       
OL,7,Fsurprise farewell from comedian John   
OL,8,FBishop during his final programme after
OL,9,Fmore than 30 years on air.             
OL,11,FBBC Radio Merseyside presenter, Sean   
OL,12,FStyles, signed off from his            
OL,13,Flong-running Sunday show at the        
OL,14,Fweekend.                               
OL,16,FDuring the programme, Bishop           
OL,17,Funexpectedly phoned in to thank the    
OL,18,Fpresenter for showing him kindness     
OL,19,Fearly in his comedy career.            
